{"product_id":"red-queen","title":"Red Queen","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Reds are commoners, ruled by a Silver elite in possesion of god-like superpowers. And to seventeen-year-old Mare, a Red girl from the poverty-stricken Stilts, it seems like nothin will ever change.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eBut Mare possesses a deadly talent of her own. One that threathens to destroy the balance of power.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eFearful of her potential, the Silvers hide Mare in plain view, declaring her a long-lost Silver princess. Knowing that one false move mean her death, Mare must use her new position to bring down the regime - from inside.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eNow Mare has entered a game of betrayal and lies.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis is Red against Silvers, prince against prince, and Mare against her own heart... \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:137 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Victoria Aveyard \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781409150725 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 383\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44285447635097,"sku":"8RC9781409150725","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/4f44e7e824ac693e7f5df8c111a6f9f8.jpg?v=1714981083","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/red-queen","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}